    "Sync sends your recordings to your own iCloud account, encrypted on this device first. Apple stores only ciphertext: no transcript, note, audio, or key ever leaves in readable form. Each project has its own key, so a device only receives the projects it keeps. Text and notes arrive on your other devices before the audio finishes.": {},
